        <p source="#source-14817-15042"><seg n="2" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-14817-14956"><seg source="#source-14844-14850">和譯</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-14850-14920" corresp="#source-14850-14883 #source-14887-14920"><seg source="#source-14883-14887">P.81</seg></hi></seg><seg source="#source-14956-14965">　１．</seg><seg source="#source-14968-14982">als seiner unw</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-81" snh:source-marker="u:" source="#source-14982-14984" corresp="#source-14965-14968 #source-14988-14991">ü</hi><seg source="#source-14984-14988">rdig</seg><seg source="#source-14991-15042"> ＝市長さんらしくもないと云つて。</seg></p>
