rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-76" snh:source-marker="o:" source="#source-377647-377649" corresp="#source-377549-377552 #source-377692-377695">ö</hi><seg source="#source-377649-377686">s werden (od. wird der Nebenmann nerv</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-76" snh:source-marker="o:" source="#source-377686-377688" corresp="#source-377549-377552 #source-377692-377695">ö</hi><seg source="#source-377688-377692">s.).</seg></p>
